    "contentHtml": "<div class=\"topic-group mb-3.5 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4 shadow-2xs transition-all\" data-group-index=\"0\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-100 pb-2.5 mb-2.5\">  <div class=\"font-bold text-sm md:text-base text-blue-700 flex items-center gap-2\">    <span class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600 shrink-0\"></span>    <span>(1) 의미</span>  </div>  <button class=\"group-toggle-btn text-xs text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded hover:bg-slate-100 flex items-center gap-1\" type=\"button\" title=\"이 항목 블러 토글\">    <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\">visibility</span>  </button></div><div class=\"group-content space-y-2 pl-1\"><div class=\"recall-item text-sm md:text-[15px] text-slate-800 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 border-l-2 border-blue-200 py-1 transition-all\">①바람직하다고 생각되는 가치들을 언어적인 방법으로 지도하는 것</div></div></div><div class=\"topic-group mb-3.5 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4 shadow-2xs transition-all\" data-group-index=\"1\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-100 pb-2.5 mb-2.5\">  <div class=\"font-bold text-sm md:text-base text-blue-700 flex items-center gap-2\">    <span class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600 shrink-0\"></span>    <span>(2) 장점</span>  </div>  <button class=\"group-toggle-btn text-xs text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded hover:bg-slate-100 flex items-center gap-1\" type=\"button\" title=\"이 항목 블러 토글\">    <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\">visibility</span>  </button></div><div class=\"group-content space-y-2 pl-1\"><div class=\"recall-item text-sm md:text-[15px] text-slate-800 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 border-l-2 border-blue-200 py-1 transition-all\">①쉽고 간단</div><div class=\"recall-item text-sm md:text-[15px] text-slate-800 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 border-l-2 border-blue-200 py-1 transition-all\">②<span class=\"mask-tape\" data-tape=\"true\" data-text=\"교사의 권위가 강한 초등 저학년에서 효과적\">교사의 권위가 강한 초등 저학년에서 효과적</span></div></div></div><div class=\"topic-group mb-3.5 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4 shadow-2xs transition-all\" data-group-index=\"2\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-100 pb-2.5 mb-2.5\">  <div class=\"font-bold text-sm md:text-base text-blue-700 flex items-center gap-2\">    <span class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600 shrink-0\"></span>    <span>(3) 단점 <span class=\"exam-badge\">23 기출</span></span>  </div>  <button class=\"group-toggle-btn text-xs text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded hover:bg-slate-100 flex items-center gap-1\" type=\"button\" title=\"이 항목 블러 토글\">    <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\">visibility</span>  </button></div><div class=\"group-content space-y-2 pl-1\"><div class=\"recall-item text-sm md:text-[15px] text-slate-800 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 border-l-2 border-blue-200 py-1 transition-all\">①학생들이 <span class=\"mask-tape\" data-tape=\"true\" data-text=\"가치갈등\">가치갈등</span>을 경험</div><div class=\"recall-item text-sm md:text-[15px] text-slate-800 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 border-l-2 border-blue-200 py-1 transition-all\">②언어에 의한 교훈은 잊어버리기 쉬움→태도, 가치관 형성에 <span class=\"mask-tape\" data-tape=\"true\" data-text=\"비효과적\">비효과적</span></div><div class=\"recall-item text-sm md:text-[15px] text-slate-800 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 border-l-2 border-blue-200 py-1 transition-all\">③사실상 주입→<span class=\"mask-tape\" data-tape=\"true\" data-text=\"다원화된 사회\">다원화된 사회</span>에 적합하지 않음</div></div></div>",
    "defaultAnswer": "1. 언어적 교훈주의\n(1) 의미\n①바람직하다고 생각되는 가치들을 언어적인 방법으로 지도하는 것\n(2) 장점\n①쉽고 간단\n②교사의 권위가 강한 초등 저학년에서 효과적\n(3) 단점 23\n①학생들이 가치갈등을 경험\n②언어에 의한 교훈은 잊어버리기 쉬움→태도, 가치관 형성에 비효과적\n③사실상 주입→다원화된 사회에 적합하지 않음",
