    "contentHtml": "<div class=\"topic-group mb-3.5 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4 shadow-2xs transition-all\" data-group-index=\"0\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-100 pb-2.5 mb-2.5\">  <div class=\"font-bold text-sm md:text-base text-blue-700 flex items-center gap-2\">    <span class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600 shrink-0\"></span>    <span>(1) 개념</span>  </div>  <button class=\"group-toggle-btn text-xs text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded hover:bg-slate-100 flex items-center gap-1\" type=\"button\" title=\"이 항목 블러 토글\">    <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\">visibility</span>  </button></div><div class=\"group-content space-y-2 pl-1\"><div class=\"recall-item text-sm md:text-[15px] text-slate-800 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 border-l-2 border-blue-200 py-1 transition-all\">①구성원들의 <span class=\"mask-tape\" data-tape=\"true\" data-text=\"권리\">권리</span>와 <span class=\"mask-tape\" data-tape=\"true\" data-text=\"이익\">이익</span>을 보호하고 안정적인 <span class=\"mask-tape\" data-tape=\"true\" data-text=\"사회생활의 유지\">사회생활의 유지</span>를 위하여 구성원들이 지켜야 하는 행위의 준칙</div><div class=\"recall-item text-sm md:text-[15px] text-slate-800 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 border-l-2 border-blue-200 py-1 transition-all\">②<span class=\"mask-tape\" data-tape=\"true\" data-text=\"국가권력에 의해 강제할 수 있는 사회규범\">국가권력에 의해 강제할 수 있는 사회규범</span></div></div></div><div class=\"topic-group mb-3.5 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4 shadow-2xs transition-all\" data-group-index=\"1\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-100 pb-2.5 mb-2.5\">  <div class=\"font-bold text-sm md:text-base text-blue-700 flex items-center gap-2\">    <span class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600 shrink-0\"></span>    <span>(2) 기능</span>  </div>  <button class=\"group-toggle-btn text-xs text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded hover:bg-slate-100 flex items-center gap-1\" type=\"button\" title=\"이 항목 블러 토글\">    <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\">visibility</span>  </button></div><div class=\"group-content space-y-2 pl-1\"><div class=\"recall-item text-sm md:text-[15px] text-slate-800 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 border-l-2 border-blue-200 py-1 transition-all\">①분쟁 해결, 사회질서 유지, 공익 추구, 정의와 인권 수호/ <span class=\"mask-tape\" data-tape=\"true\" data-text=\"행위\">행위</span>규범, <span class=\"mask-tape\" data-tape=\"true\" data-text=\"재판\">재판</span>규범</div></div></div><div class=\"topic-group mb-3.5 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4 shadow-2xs transition-all\" data-group-index=\"2\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-100 pb-2.5 mb-2.5\">  <div class=\"font-bold text-sm md:text-base text-blue-700 flex items-center gap-2\">    <span class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600 shrink-0\"></span>    <span>(3) 법과 도덕</span>  </div>  <button class=\"group-toggle-btn text-xs text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded hover:bg-slate-100 flex items-center gap-1\" type=\"button\" title=\"이 항목 블러 토글\">    <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\">visibility</span>  </button></div><div class=\"group-content space-y-2 pl-1\"><div class=\"recall-item text-sm md:text-[15px] text-slate-800 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 border-l-2 border-blue-200 py-1 transition-all\">①법: 정의 추구, <span class=\"mask-tape\" data-tape=\"true\" data-text=\"강제성\">강제성</span>, 타율성, <span class=\"mask-tape\" data-tape=\"true\" data-text=\"외면성\">외면성</span>, <span class=\"mask-tape\" data-tape=\"true\" data-text=\"합법성\">합법성</span>, 양면성</div><div class=\"recall-item text-sm md:text-[15px] text-slate-800 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 border-l-2 border-blue-200 py-1 transition-all\">②도덕: 선 추구, <span class=\"mask-tape\" data-tape=\"true\" data-text=\"비강제성\">비강제성</span>, 자율성, <span class=\"mask-tape\" data-tape=\"true\" data-text=\"내면성\">내면성</span>, <span class=\"mask-tape\" data-tape=\"true\" data-text=\"도덕성\">도덕성</span>, 일면성</div><div class=\"recall-item text-sm md:text-[15px] text-slate-800 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 border-l-2 border-blue-200 py-1 transition-all\">③서로 중첩하여 존재 – 상호조화와 대립의 관계</div><div class=\"recall-item text-xs md:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed pl-6 py-0.5 transition-all\">- ex) 민법의 선량한 풍속, 형법의 사회상규에 위배되지 않는 행위 등</div></div></div>",
