    "contentHtml": "<div class=\"topic-group mb-3.5 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4 shadow-2xs transition-all\" data-group-index=\"0\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-100 pb-2.5 mb-2.5\">  <div class=\"font-bold text-sm md:text-base text-blue-700 flex items-center gap-2\">    <span class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600 shrink-0\"></span>    <span>(1) 수사 개시</span>  </div>  <button class=\"group-toggle-btn text-xs text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded hover:bg-slate-100 flex items-center gap-1\" type=\"button\" title=\"이 항목 블러 토글\">    <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\">visibility</span>  </button></div><div class=\"group-content space-y-2 pl-1\"><div class=\"recall-item text-sm md:text-[15px] text-slate-800 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 border-l-2 border-blue-200 py-1 transition-all\">고소(피해자가), 고발(제3자), 현행법 체포, 수사기관 인지</div></div></div><div class=\"topic-group mb-3.5 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4 shadow-2xs transition-all\" data-group-index=\"1\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-100 pb-2.5 mb-2.5\">  <div class=\"font-bold text-sm md:text-base text-blue-700 flex items-center gap-2\">    <span class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600 shrink-0\"></span>    <span>(2) 수사</span>  </div>  <button class=\"group-toggle-btn text-xs text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded hover:bg-slate-100 flex items-center gap-1\" type=\"button\" title=\"이 항목 블러 토글\">    <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\">visibility</span>  </button></div><div class=\"group-content space-y-2 pl-1\"><div class=\"recall-item text-sm md:text-[15px] text-slate-800 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 border-l-2 border-blue-200 py-1 transition-all\">불구속 수사가 원칙. 구속수사는 검사의 청구로 법관의 발부로 체포, 구속, 압수, 수색 영장</div><div class=\"recall-item text-sm md:text-[15px] text-slate-800 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 border-l-2 border-blue-200 py-1 transition-all\">①체포: 예외적으로 현행범, 중대한 범죄의 경우 영장 없이 가능</div></div></div><div class=\"topic-group mb-3.5 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4 shadow-2xs transition-all\" data-group-index=\"2\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-100 pb-2.5 mb-2.5\">  <div class=\"font-bold text-sm md:text-base text-blue-700 flex items-center gap-2\">    <span class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600 shrink-0\"></span>    <span>(3) 수사 종결</span>  </div>  <button class=\"group-toggle-btn text-xs text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded hover:bg-slate-100 flex items-center gap-1\" type=\"button\" title=\"이 항목 블러 토글\">    <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\">visibility</span>  </button></div><div class=\"group-content space-y-2 pl-1\"><div class=\"recall-item text-sm md:text-[15px] text-slate-800 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 border-l-2 border-blue-200 py-1 transition-all\">①사법경찰관의 검사에게 송치or불송치</div><div class=\"recall-item text-sm md:text-[15px] text-slate-800 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 border-l-2 border-blue-200 py-1 transition-all\">②검사는 기소(공판) or 불기소</div><div class=\"recall-item text-sm md:text-[15px] text-slate-800 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 border-l-2 border-blue-200 py-1 transition-all\">③불기소: 혐의 없음, 죄 안됨(위법성, 책임성 조각), 공소권 없음(피의자 사망), 기소유예(정상참작)</div></div></div><div class=\"topic-group mb-3.5 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4 shadow-2xs transition-all\" data-group-index=\"3\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-100 pb-2.5 mb-2.5\">  <div class=\"font-bold text-sm md:text-base text-blue-700 flex items-center gap-2\">    <span class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600 shrink-0\"></span>    <span>(4) 범인 발견, 범죄의 증거를 수집·발견하는 단계</span>  </div>  <button class=\"group-toggle-btn text-xs text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded hover:bg-slate-100 flex items-center gap-1\" type=\"button\" title=\"이 항목 블러 토글\">    <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\">visibility</span>  </button></div><div class=\"group-content space-y-2 pl-1\"></div></div><div class=\"topic-group mb-3.5 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4 shadow-2xs transition-all\" data-group-index=\"4\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-100 pb-2.5 mb-2.5\">  <div class=\"font-bold text-sm md:text-base text-blue-700 flex items-center gap-2\">    <span class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600 shrink-0\"></span>    <span>(5) 피의자</span>  </div>  <button class=\"group-toggle-btn text-xs text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded hover:bg-slate-100 flex items-center gap-1\" type=\"button\" title=\"이 항목 블러 토글\">    <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\">visibility</span>  </button></div><div class=\"group-content space-y-2 pl-1\"><div class=\"recall-item text-sm md:text-[15px] text-slate-800 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 border-l-2 border-blue-200 py-1 transition-all\">수사 시작 후 참고인은 수사를 받는 자로 변경</div></div></div><div class=\"topic-group mb-3.5 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4 shadow-2xs transition-all\" data-group-index=\"5\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-100 pb-2.5 mb-2.5\">  <div class=\"font-bold text-sm md:text-base text-blue-700 flex items-center gap-2\">    <span class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600 shrink-0\"></span>    <span>(6) 수사기관</span>  </div>  <button class=\"group-toggle-btn text-xs text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded hover:bg-slate-100 flex items-center gap-1\" type=\"button\" title=\"이 항목 블러 토글\">    <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\">visibility</span>  </button></div><div class=\"group-content space-y-2 pl-1\"><div class=\"recall-item text-sm md:text-[15px] text-slate-800 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 border-l-2 border-blue-200 py-1 transition-all\">검사, 사법경찰관</div></div></div>",
    "defaultAnswer": "2. 수사 절차\n(1) 수사 개시: 고소(피해자가), 고발(제3자), 현행법 체포, 수사기관 인지\n\n(2) 수사: 불구속 수사가 원칙. 구속수사는 검사의 청구로 법관의 발부로 체포, 구속, 압수, 수색 영장\n①체포: 예외적으로 현행범, 중대한 범죄의 경우 영장 없이 가능\n(3) 수사 종결\n①사법경찰관의 검사에게 송치or불송치\n②검사는 기소(공판) or 불기소\n③불기소: 혐의 없음, 죄 안됨(위법성, 책임성 조각), 공소권 없음(피의자 사망), 기소유예(정상참작)\n(4) 범인 발견, 범죄의 증거를 수집·발견하는 단계\n\n(5) 피의자: 수사 시작 후 참고인은 수사를 받는 자로 변경\n\n(6) 수사기관: 검사, 사법경찰관\n",
