    "contentHtml": "<div class=\"topic-group mb-3.5 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4 shadow-2xs transition-all\" data-group-index=\"0\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-100 pb-2.5 mb-2.5\">  <div class=\"font-bold text-sm md:text-base text-blue-700 flex items-center gap-2\">    <span class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600 shrink-0\"></span>    <span>(1) 종류</span>  </div>  <button class=\"group-toggle-btn text-xs text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded hover:bg-slate-100 flex items-center gap-1\" type=\"button\" title=\"이 항목 블러 토글\">    <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\">visibility</span>  </button></div><div class=\"group-content space-y-2 pl-1\"><div class=\"recall-item text-sm md:text-[15px] text-slate-800 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 border-l-2 border-blue-200 py-1 transition-all\">①<span class=\"mask-tape\" data-tape=\"true\" data-text=\"불이익취급\">불이익취급</span>, <span class=\"mask-tape\" data-tape=\"true\" data-text=\"황견계약\">황견계약</span>, <span class=\"mask-tape\" data-tape=\"true\" data-text=\"정당한 이유없는 단체교섭 거부\">정당한 이유없는 단체교섭 거부</span>, <span class=\"mask-tape\" data-tape=\"true\" data-text=\"지배·개입\">지배·개입</span></div></div></div><div class=\"topic-group mb-3.5 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4 shadow-2xs transition-all\" data-group-index=\"1\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-100 pb-2.5 mb-2.5\">  <div class=\"font-bold text-sm md:text-base text-blue-700 flex items-center gap-2\">    <span class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600 shrink-0\"></span>    <span>(2) 구제절차</span>  </div>  <button class=\"group-toggle-btn text-xs text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded hover:bg-slate-100 flex items-center gap-1\" type=\"button\" title=\"이 항목 블러 토글\">    <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\">visibility</span>  </button></div><div class=\"group-content space-y-2 pl-1\"><div class=\"recall-item text-sm md:text-[15px] text-slate-800 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 border-l-2 border-blue-200 py-1 transition-all\">①<span class=\"mask-tape\" data-tape=\"true\" data-text=\"노동위원회\">노동위원회</span>에 의한 구제</div><div class=\"recall-item text-xs md:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed pl-6 py-0.5 transition-all\">- 근로자 or 노동조합의 구제 신청 – 부당노동행위가 있은지 3월 이내</div><div class=\"recall-item text-xs md:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed pl-6 py-0.5 transition-all\">- 구제 제기: 근로자, <span class=\"mask-tape\" data-tape=\"true\" data-text=\"노동조합\">노동조합</span></div><div class=\"recall-item text-sm md:text-[15px] text-slate-800 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 border-l-2 border-blue-200 py-1 transition-all\">②형사고소</div><div class=\"recall-item text-sm md:text-[15px] text-slate-800 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 border-l-2 border-blue-200 py-1 transition-all\">③민사소송</div></div></div><div class=\"topic-group mb-3.5 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4 shadow-2xs transition-all\" data-group-index=\"2\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-100 pb-2.5 mb-2.5\">  <div class=\"font-bold text-sm md:text-base text-blue-700 flex items-center gap-2\">    <span class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600 shrink-0\"></span>    <span>(3) 부당해고와 부당노동행위 차이</span>  </div>  <button class=\"group-toggle-btn text-xs text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded hover:bg-slate-100 flex items-center gap-1\" type=\"button\" title=\"이 항목 블러 토글\">    <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\">visibility</span>  </button></div><div class=\"group-content space-y-2 pl-1\"><div class=\"recall-item text-sm md:text-[15px] text-slate-800 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 border-l-2 border-blue-200 py-1 transition-all\">①부당해고: 근로기준법에 명시, 근로자 개인 신청 및 구제</div><div class=\"recall-item text-sm md:text-[15px] text-slate-800 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 border-l-2 border-blue-200 py-1 transition-all\">②부당노동행위: 노동조합 및 노동관계조정법에 명시, 근로자 개인 및 노동조합 구제</div><div class=\"recall-item text-xs md:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed pl-6 py-0.5 transition-all\">*기타</div><div class=\"recall-item text-xs md:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed pl-6 py-0.5 transition-all\">- 국제법의 법원: 조약, 국제관습, 법의 일반원칙</div><div class=\"recall-item text-xs md:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed pl-6 py-0.5 transition-all\">-</div></div></div>",
    "defaultAnswer": "5. 부당노동행위 – 사용자가 근로자의 근로3권을 침해하는 행위를 유형화한 것\n(1) 종류\n①불이익취급, 황견계약, 정당한 이유없는 단체교섭 거부, 지배·개입\n(2) 구제절차\n①노동위원회에 의한 구제\n- 근로자 or 노동조합의 구제 신청 – 부당노동행위가 있은지 3월 이내\n- 구제 제기: 근로자, 노동조합\n②형사고소\n③민사소송\n(3) 부당해고와 부당노동행위 차이\n①부당해고: 근로기준법에 명시, 근로자 개인 신청 및 구제\n②부당노동행위: 노동조합 및 노동관계조정법에 명시, 근로자 개인 및 노동조합 구제\n*기타\n- 국제법의 법원: 조약, 국제관습, 법의 일반원칙\n-",
