    "contentHtml": "<div class=\"topic-group mb-3.5 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4 shadow-2xs transition-all\" data-group-index=\"0\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-100 pb-2.5 mb-2.5\">  <div class=\"font-bold text-sm md:text-base text-blue-700 flex items-center gap-2\">    <span class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600 shrink-0\"></span>    <span>(1) 권력 융합적 특성</span>  </div>  <button class=\"group-toggle-btn text-xs text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded hover:bg-slate-100 flex items-center gap-1\" type=\"button\" title=\"이 항목 블러 토글\">    <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\">visibility</span>  </button></div><div class=\"group-content space-y-2 pl-1\"><div class=\"recall-item text-sm md:text-[15px] text-slate-800 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 border-l-2 border-blue-200 py-1 transition-all\">①행정부와 의회가 <span class=\"mask-tape\" data-tape=\"true\" data-text=\"둘 다\">둘 다</span> 법률안 제출 가능</div><div class=\"recall-item text-sm md:text-[15px] text-slate-800 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 border-l-2 border-blue-200 py-1 transition-all\">②의회 권력과 행정권력 간 <span class=\"mask-tape\" data-tape=\"true\" data-text=\"마찰\">마찰</span>이 없음</div></div></div><div class=\"topic-group mb-3.5 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4 shadow-2xs transition-all\" data-group-index=\"1\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-100 pb-2.5 mb-2.5\">  <div class=\"font-bold text-sm md:text-base text-blue-700 flex items-center gap-2\">    <span class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600 shrink-0\"></span>    <span>(2) 의회가 <span class=\"mask-tape\" data-tape=\"true\" data-text=\"내각불신임권\">내각불신임권</span>을 가짐</span>  </div>  <button class=\"group-toggle-btn text-xs text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded hover:bg-slate-100 flex items-center gap-1\" type=\"button\" title=\"이 항목 블러 토글\">    <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\">visibility</span>  </button></div><div class=\"group-content space-y-2 pl-1\"><div class=\"recall-item text-sm md:text-[15px] text-slate-800 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 border-l-2 border-blue-200 py-1 transition-all\">①<span class=\"mask-tape\" data-tape=\"true\" data-text=\"민주적 책임성\">민주적 책임성</span> 보장: 국민의 대의기구인 의회를 통해, 행정부가 국민에게 책임을 짐</div><div class=\"recall-item text-xs md:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed pl-6 py-0.5 transition-all\">- 불신임결의는 의회가 내각의 실정에 대해 정치적 책임을 지도록 강요하는 것</div><div class=\"recall-item text-xs md:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed pl-6 py-0.5 transition-all\">- <span class=\"mask-tape\" data-tape=\"true\" data-text=\"건설적 불신임\">건설적 불신임</span>(독일): 의회의 무책임하고 무분별한 내각 불신임을 방지하여 정국의 불안정을 막고 행정부(내각)의 <span class=\"mask-tape\" data-tape=\"true\" data-text=\"안정성\">안정성</span>을 확보</div><div class=\"recall-item text-sm md:text-[15px] text-slate-800 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 border-l-2 border-blue-200 py-1 transition-all\">②내각의 <span class=\"mask-tape\" data-tape=\"true\" data-text=\"정치적 반응성\">정치적 반응성</span> 높음: 불신임 가능성으로 인해 여론에 예민</div><div class=\"recall-item text-sm md:text-[15px] text-slate-800 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 border-l-2 border-blue-200 py-1 transition-all\">③이때 총리는 의회 해산하여 의회의 구성 변화 가능→의회에 정치적 부담</div><div class=\"recall-item text-sm md:text-[15px] text-slate-800 leading-relaxed pl-3.5 border-l-2 border-blue-200 py-1 transition-all\">④각료회의는 <span class=\"mask-tape\" data-tape=\"true\" data-text=\"필수기관\">필수기관</span>이자, 정부의 정책을 결정하는 <span class=\"mask-tape\" data-tape=\"true\" data-text=\"의결기관\">의결기관</span></div></div></div>",
